---
title: Converting an old iMac into mini PC and monitor
description: In my attempt to reduce my personal e-waste, I repurpose a beloved 27" iMac into an HDMI display and separate small form factor PC.
date: 2026-08-31
tags: [hardware]
draft: true
---


My first personal computer was a Core 2 Duo MacBook from
Apple's "Black and White" era. It remains, in my opinion,
the best designed Apple laptop of all time, in the pantheon
of design greats with the [iMac G4](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IMac_G4)
and [iPhone 4](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_4).


![Black Apple MacBook](./macbook.jpg "Not my photo, as I didn't even have a cell phone at the time!)

Alas, the years took their toll on both the software and the physical case
(the black plastic had a tendency to crack along edges), and in early 2012
I had declared my Computer Science undergraduate major and was in need of a better device.





